                    {"label": "均值不等式（二元）", "latex": "\\frac{a+b}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{ab}\\ (a,b \\in \\mathbb{R}^+)"},
                    {"label": "立方均值不等式", "latex": "a^3 + b^3 + c^3 \\geq 3abc\\ (a>0,b>0,c>0)"},
