                    {"label": "等比数列通项", "latex": "a_n = a_1 q^{n-1}"},
                    {"label": "等比数列前n项和", "latex": "S_n = \\begin{cases} na_1, & q=1 \\\\ \\dfrac{a_1(1-q^n)}{1-q} = \\dfrac{a_1-a_n q}{1-q}, & q\\neq 1 \\end{cases}"}
