                    {"label": "全排列（阶乘）", "latex": "n! = n(n-1)\\cdots 3\\cdot 2\\cdot 1"},
                    {"label": "组合数", "latex": "C_n^k = \\frac{A_n^k}{k!} = \\frac{n!}{(n-k)!k!}"},
